s://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a9Em7X1bNR4MmSNAxkEQDtkaeNr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"In Dreams\",\"overview\":\"Puss and friends' quest for the second Gem of the Crown piece gets them caught by a spidery witch who casts Puss into a crazy dream-filled sleep.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/idd1N8hyaffDGpLTCCwfiSTzKeu.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Fluteus Maximus\",\"overview\":\"Puss and pals outwit a flute-playing witch who guards a piece of the gem they seek. But a stunning twist awaits when they obtain the precious shard.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/foWpcoMZq5Mk7lgfNmy8j7lqg6r.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Prey Time\",\"overview\":\"As our feline hero tests his survival skills upon mysteriously waking in the jungle, San Lorenzo's citizens frantically search for the vanished Puss.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sNcdnph00n4g9MmV8bXhPzGFGDs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Breaking Good\",\"overview\":\"Dulcinea's school for wayward thieves inspires a misguided Uli. Meanwhile, pugnacious Puss struggles to keep his feisty paws off the reforming thugs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gawJUQYCHC5ydTu3llrfbpZFOwm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Written By\",\"overview\":\"When the Crown of Souls remains inert even with its powerful gem restored, Dulcinea seeks out her favorite author in hopes that he'll have answers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nOQqXmG7K7nyFXRVYFtlgoH82Jt.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Fancy Beast\",\"overview\":\"To obtain a priceless book about the Crown of Souls, Puss, Dulcinea and Miguela try to trick a pompous man-eating ogre, with unexpected help from Uli.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tygE5Ivx62DaUxqMTCTXJpMMuik.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Titan Up\",\"overview\":\"Sky god Taranis is convinced Puss has great powers that could help control belligerent god Toutatis, who's vowed to destroy all mortals.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ribuVaYgwtUBM28vY0MqZZbbYAD.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Boar Games\",\"overview\":\"Pajuna's old partner Roz comes to town seeking her help with a mission. But the person Roz means to snuff out is Puss, who's off on his own quest.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4dlZtBK7P9SWCIC3GRvZZf71GoZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Small Change\",\"overview\":\"While seeking out Sphinx's sister for clues about the Obelisk, Puss falls into the Fountain of 100 Changes and becomes one fractured, frazzled kitty.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mf67UhIEIWXNonYnHEyTWStZed9.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Little Lamb\",\"overview\":\"When valiant Puss and his entourage try to get the Obelisk of Night from Angus, the sheep presents them with perhaps their greatest challenge yet.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kAlYqLm9k7YPvSDnZ5Shxn7klzf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Obelisk\",\"overview\":\"Having learned the location of the Obelisk, Puss and company return to San Lorenzo to find the town overtaken by El Moco, who's got a score to settle.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/35VwZNxoXH0YEO8BWIUXV48rP8U.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"The Bloodwolf\",\"overview\":\"When the fearsome Bloodwolf finally rises, the people of San Lorenzo fight back and soon learn the identity of the one person who can stop the demon.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ad6exSSGQ29YXBEKdHgpvmnGnB3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-16\",\"runtime\":24}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-01-16\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}